    "intro_text": "Next, roll 1d10 for each category included in the Night Market to determine how many types of items are available. Then roll d100 that many times on the appropriate columns below to see what's there. If you roll the same result twice, reroll until you get a different result. If you roll an item that has multiple Quality Ratings, all Quality Ratings are present in the Night Market. This is not the total inventory, but a general listing of types of things available in the Market.",
